OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be mainly dry 
OL,6,Fand cloudy. Then this afternoon will   
OL,7,Fbe cloudy with rain spreading          
OL,8,Fnortheast. Strong southeasterly wind   
OL,9,Falong North Sea coasts, easing later.  
OL,11,CTonight:FRain will clear away          
OL,12,Fnortheastwards this evening. Then the  
OL,13,Frest of the night will be dry with     
OL,14,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear    
OL,15,Fperiods.                               
OL,17,CSunday:FAfter a dry and bright start   
OL,18,Fshowery rain will spread east for a    
OL,19,Ftime in the morning. Mainly dry and    
OL,20,Fbright in the afternoon, a few showers 
OL,21,Fin the west.                           
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
