OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild  
OL,6,Fand windy on Monday with rain in the   
OL,7,Fwest, mainly dry in the east. Early    
OL,8,Frain on Tuesday then dry and bright.   
OL,9,FShowers in west Wednesday, dry east.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
